        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Billy Nungesser, Kip Holden, John Bel Edwards, David Vitter\n- Events: Louisiana lieutenant gubernatorial election, 2015; Louisiana gubernatorial election, 2015\n- Roles: Lieutenant Governor of Louisiana, Governor of Louisiana, United States Senator, lobbyist, lawyer, politician\n\nFacts:\n- David Bruce Vitter was born on May 3, 1961.\n- In 2015, Billy Nungesser won the Louisiana lieutenant gubernatorial election by defeating Kip Holden.\n- In 2015, Democrat John Bel Edwards won the Louisiana gubernatorial election by defeating David Vitter by a similar margin.\n- David Vitter served as a United States Senator for Louisiana from 2005 to 2017.\n- David Vitter is an American lobbyist, lawyer, and politician.",
